{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31406","headline":"荅问读书居 · 莫宣卿","name":"荅问读书居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"书屋倚麒麟，不同牛马路。\n牀头万卷书，溪上五龙渡。\n井汲冽寒泉，桂花香玉露。\n茅檐无外物，只见青云护。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"莫宣卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31406.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31406","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}